  "scope": "Move the public native-import and readiness facade bodies behind concrete runtime and canonical Import owner operations. The facades must not construct NativeImportParts, read import status stores, or build History/Insomnia/Dream owner capabilities. Preserve public signatures and readiness/admission sequencing, duplicate scope reads, error mapping, import write activity updates and panic behavior.",
  "contracts": [
    "Import remains owner of canonical admission, readiness policy, refusal and commit order.",
